{
    "id":  10520,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Pendant Lamp - KROKOM - 24W - CRI88",
    "reference":  "91744",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eOur KROKOM \u003cstrong\u003eWhite Pendant Lamp\u003c/strong\u003e offers minimalist and avant-garde styles for all kinds of \u003cstrong\u003edesign\u003c/strong\u003e decoration, stands out for its shiny silver color and has been manufactured in high resistance \u003cstrong\u003ealuminum\u003c/strong\u003e. The lamp has a power of \u003cstrong\u003e24W\u003c/strong\u003e and a high \u003cstrong\u003eCRI 88\u003c/strong\u003e. In addition, its \u003cstrong\u003eheight is adjustable\u003c/strong\u003e up to a maximum of \u003cstrong\u003e150cm\u003c/strong\u003e, so it can be adapted to various environments and places in the home or office.  \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003einstallation\u003c/strong\u003e is very \u003cstrong\u003esimple\u003c/strong\u003e and quick so that anyone can assemble it following the instructions.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eKROKOM White Design Pendant Light 24W 4000K\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAvant-garde and elegant lighting for any space.\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe designer\u003cstrong\u003e white pendant lamp\u003c/strong\u003e is a modern and elegant option for any interior space. Its minimalist design adapts to any decorating style, but above all it creates avant-garde environments for exclusive and glamorous spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe lamp is made of high quality aluminum, with a shiny silver finish that gives it a modern and sophisticated look. The suspension cable is adjustable, so you can adapt the height of the lamp to your needs. The base and its accessories in white so as not to lose the main tone of the luminaire. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis lamp has a power of \u003cstrong\u003e24W\u003c/strong\u003e, a \u003cstrong\u003enatural\u003c/strong\u003e white light temperature of \u003cstrong\u003e4000K\u003c/strong\u003e and a color rendering index of 88 (CRI). This means that the lamp produces a pleasant, natural white light, which is ideal for most tasks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur lamps offer high performance and can be on the cover of any decorating magazine, don\u0027t wait any longer to buy your designer lamp and get a unique lighting!!!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCutting-edge minimalist design.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade of high quality aluminum\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShiny white finish\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable suspension cable\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e24W power\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4000K light temperature\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColor rendering index of 88\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBenefits:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModern and elegant lighting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdaptable to any style of decoration\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to install\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSaves energy\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduces a natural and pleasant white light\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstallation:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisconnect the socket\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMark the points on the ceiling where the holes for the bracket are to be drilled.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrill the holes and drive in the plugs\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScrew the bracket to the ceiling\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnect the lamp to the mains\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFit the base to the bracket with its accessories\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnect the socket\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of KROKOM White Design Pendant Light 24W 4000K\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKitchen\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDining room\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiving room\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBedroom\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffice\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEvent\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReception\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
